<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ First, Labour meeting postponed again.</title>
<headline>NZ First, Labour meeting postponed again.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A meeting between the New Zealand First Party and Labour Party has been postponed again, parliamentary staff said on Friday.</p>
<p>The parties were due to meet for further coalition talks on Thursday evening and a Labour spokesman earlier said the parties would meet again this evening.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
